{"id": "d43f6af6f242450b97f62ab4bd14f4ca", "text": "the Lord  in our hearts.  Just as the travelers  on the ship faced violent  \nturbulence  due to strong  winds,  we also feel great  perturbance  in our minds  \ndue to strong  swaying  of our sense  organs.  The travelers  saw Sri \nMadhwacharya  and cried  for help. Acharya  rescued  them  immediately . \nSimilarly,  if we turn to Sri Madhwacharya  (an incarnation  of Sri Vayu deva) \nasking  for help in traversing  this ocean  of samsara , he will rescue  us and \nland us safely  in moksha .", "embedding": [0.005150354001671076, 0.02856707014143467, 0.01915566250681877, 0.006130126304924488, 0.042621441185474396, -0.04640853404998779, 0.06673754006624222, -0.07780341058969498, 0.03950263559818268, 0.006943144369870424, 0.02238595299422741, -0.050908662378787994, 0.038986168801784515, 0.007782355882227421, 0.015951504930853844, 0.0444527193903923, -0.028935100883245468, -0.03925225883722305, -0.05685830116271973, 0.058371078222990036, -0.032993484288454056, 0.10175734013319016, -0.059379156678915024, -0.009718567132949829, -0.06792120635509491, -0.0476873442530632, 0.07752934098243713, -0.031457509845495224, 0.006318553350865841, -0.030091101303696632, 0.04497060924768448, -0.04769425094127655, -0.1218523234128952, 0.049286190420389175, -0.08200448751449585, 0.16405066847801208, 0.013290250673890114, 0.043990641832351685, -0.012255280278623104, -0.03986277058720589, -0.022068236023187637, 0.013926338404417038, 0.04306776821613312, 0.01601271890103817, 0.08179554343223572, -0.11539480835199356, -0.06940102577209473, -0.07735255360603333, 0.04811476916074753, -0.004536156076937914, -0.10364607721567154, -0.012386971153318882, -0.059992652386426926, 0.026799961924552917, -0.004182481672614813, -0.03123534470796585, 0.006062133237719536, -0.06662635505199432, 0.026098815724253654, -0.06023146212100983, 0.012306922115385532, 0.03577103093266487, 0.05255284905433655, -0.013041692785918713, -0.025477182120084763, -0.128